NOTICE
======

Xevious (1982) is a game by Namco. The Amstrad CPC 6128 version used as the
basis of this port (Easter Egg, 2026) is by Nemo (code, sound) and TotO
(graphics), with the Arkos Tracker player by Targhan and the ZX0 compressor by
Einar Saukas. All rights in the original games, their audiovisual assets and
music remain with the respective copyright holders.

This repository contains only original work of the port authors — Vector-06C
platform code (`src/vec/`), the i8080 translation and JS model of the game
logic (`src/i80/`, `src/model/`), SkoolKit control files with the authors'
annotations (`src/cpc/`), tools (`tools/`), documentation (`docs/`) and the
README — licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE). No data from the
original disk (code, graphics, music, screens) is included; the build reads it
from a disk image you supply (`ref/cpc/`, not included).

This project is not affiliated with Namco / Bandai Namco or the authors of the
Amstrad CPC version.
